[Event "Knight School"]
[Opening "Traxler Counterattack"]
[Variation "7.Ke1 Qh4+"]
[ECO "C57"]
[Character "tactical"]
[Risk "medium"]
[EarlyMate "black"]
[Tricks "trap,mate-threat"]
[Refutes "1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bc4 Nf6 4. Ng5 Bc5 5. Nxf7 Bxf2+ 6. Kxf2 Nxe4+ 7. Ke1"]

1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bc4 Nf6 4. Ng5 Bc5 5. Nxf7 Bxf2+ 6. Kxf2 Nxe4+ 7. Ke1? { Steps back into the centre, but the king is still in reach of the queen. } 7... Qh4+ { Check, and the knight on e4 covers g3 and f2 as well. White has no good answer. } 8. g3 8... Nxg3 { Opens the h-file with a discovered threat against the rook on h1. } 9. hxg3 9... Qxh1 { Wins the rook. Black is far ahead. } 10. Bf1 10... O-O *
